          "limitations": "Does not block area effects, environmental hazards, effects that do not target the warded creature directly, or attacks from creatures immune to this ward. Sanctuary ends immediately if the warded creature intentionally deals damage or forces a hostile creature to make a saving throw. It never compels belief or allegiance and does not remove an attacker's entire Action unless no legal alternative exists. Ranked casting causes normal Dissonance and Refrain. This is defensive target restriction, not permission to impose another whole-Action denial: on a failed save the attacker may choose a legal different target or a different Action if its Action has not otherwise resolved.",
